<<ProfileLog $mom "The Crawl" "On the Friday after the silent week she stayed late at the office and apologized. I didn't look up, and told her I hadn't missed her once. She changed into the green dress from her cousin's wedding and crawled across the office to my desk, took her line back and asked me nicely to let her use her mouth. I told her exactly how pathetic she looked while she did it. From now on she brings my coffee in the morning, and that with it, and she thanked me for it. Then I sent her back to the bathroom on her knees.">>
<<ProfileMemory $mom "The green dress" "She was almost sure it still fit. It does. She left her heels in the office bathroom and came to me barefoot, on her knees, with her eyes on me the whole way across the room, and went back the same way.">>
